{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15474","headline":"奉和秘书元丞杪秋忆终南旧居 · 李端","name":"奉和秘书元丞杪秋忆终南旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高门有才子，能履古人踪。\n白社陶元亮，青云阮仲容。\n田园忽归去，车马杳难逢。\n废巷临秋水，支颐向暮峰。\n行鱼避杨柳，惊鸭触芙蓉。\n石窦红泉细，山桥紫菜重。\n凤雏终食竹，鹤侣暂巢松。\n愿接烟霞赏，羁离计不从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}